Subject: [PATCH 079/157] Optimize sun burn tick checks for sun-sensitive mobs

- Cache eye and skeleton block positions to eliminate redundant BlockPosition heap allocations during sun burn ticks

- Overload Entity.aw(BlockPosition) to calculate brightness without MutableBlockPosition allocations

- Add toml configuration toggle optimize-sun-burn-tick in optimizations.sun-burn (defaults to true)

